PTX MP+fence-restrict-cta+remote-shared
"As MP+fence-restrict-cta+shared with the data in the shared memory of the other CTA: not the executing CTA's shared::cta space, so not ordered (D18). Expected: allowed."
{
s=0 @cta 1;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                         | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0  ;
 st.weak.shared::cluster s, 1                     | ld.relaxed.cluster r0, f  ;
 fence.release.sync_restrict::shared::cta.cluster | fence.acq_rel.cluster     ;
 st.relaxed.cluster f, 1                          | ld.weak.shared::cta r1, s ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
